    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported an overall release of GBP 47.547 million in gross prior year reserves for underwriting years 2011-2014. This favorable development was driven by class reviews, favorable outcomes on specific losses, and a large release of reserves from the 2012 account due to a favorable court ruling on a Hurricane Sandy related claim. Additionally, loss experience on Cyber facilities was better than expected, leading to further releases. However, these releases were partially offset by a strengthening of reserves for an old Energy claim following an adverse Danish court ruling in December 2016 and increased reserves for a fire at a power plant in Guam.",
